OL,3,GNEWSATen jailed for 130 years after
OL,4,Amother set on fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTen men have been jailed for a combined
OL,7,F130 years after a mother was set on
OL,8,Ffire in a revenge attack that also
OL,9,Fseriously injured a teenage girl.
OL,11,FTo escape the flames at a house on
OL,12,FBeverley Drive in Stoke-on-Trent, on
OL,13,Fthe night of 16 December 2021, both
OL,14,Fvictims were forced to jump from an
OL,15,Fupstairs window they had smashed.
OL,17,FThe convictions of the ten men involved
OL,18,Fcame after an 11-week trial at
OL,19,FNottingham Crown Court, which ended in
OL,20,FFebruary, alongside a number of guilty
OL,21,Fpleas entered before the trial began.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
