OL,3,GNEWSATen jailed for 130 years after
OL,4,Amother set on fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Con Howard Davies from
OL,7,FStaffordshire Police's major
OL,8,Finvestigations department said the
OL,9,Fviolence had been " truly shocking" and
OL,10,Fhad "put lives at grave risk".
